            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-sm bg-gold/10 border border-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-heading">Missed Call Texts & Smart Automations</h3>
                <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-1 rounded-sm bg-gold/10 text-gold border border-gold/20 font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">From $15/mo</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Miss a call while you're on a job? We automatically send a text back so you don't lose the lead. We also integrate with the tools you already use, like FieldPulse, Jobber, ServiceTitan, and Housecall Pro, to pull your customer lists and send seasonal promotional emails automatically.
              </p>
              <div class="bg-[#FAFAF8] dark:bg-surface-darker border border-[#E8E4DC] dark:border-border-dark rounded-sm p-4">
                <p class="text-sm text-secondary italic">
                  <span class="text-gold font-semibold not-italic">Real example:</span> Our HVAC client sends a "get your AC serviced before summer" email to his full customer list every spring, and a "get your furnace checked before winter" email every fall. It's all automated. He doesn't touch it. The emails go out, the phone rings, and he books jobs he would've missed.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 6: Contractor Website -->
        <div class="card p-6 md:p-8 hover:border-gold/30 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6 items-start">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-sm bg-gold/10 border border-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21a9 9 0 100-18 9 9 0 000 18zm0-18c2.5 3 4 6.5 4 9s-1.5 6-4 9m0-18c-2.5 3-4 6.5-4 9s1.5 6 4 9m-9-9h18" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-heading">A Website Built for Your Trade</h3>
                <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-1 rounded-sm bg-gold/10 text-gold border border-gold/20 font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">Included in Full Package</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Fast, mobile-first, and designed to turn visitors into booked jobs. Click-to-call buttons, online estimate request forms, service area pages that rank in local search, and a project gallery that updates itself from your job photos. No templates. Built specifically for your business.
              </p>
              <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-secondary">
                  <span class="text-gold text-xs mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
                  <span>Click-to-call on every page</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-secondary">
                  <span class="text-gold text-xs mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
                  <span>Online estimate forms</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-secondary">
                  <span class="text-gold text-xs mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
                  <span>Service area pages for local SEO</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-secondary">
                  <span class="text-gold text-xs mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
                  <span>Auto-syncing project gallery</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-secondary">
                  <span class="text-gold text-xs mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
                  <span>Google Business Profile optimization</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-secondary">
                  <span class="text-gold text-xs mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
                  <span>Managed hosting and maintenance</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-12">
        <p class="text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-6">
          And that's just the start. If your trade business needs help with it, we can build it. <span class="text-gold font-semibold">All for $100/month.</span>
        </p>
        <a href="#pricing" class="btn-outline px-8 py-4">
          See Pricing
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════ PHOTO BREAK: WIRING ═══════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative h-64 sm:h-72 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: url('/images/reno-wiring.webp');"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    <div class="relative text-center px-4">
      <p class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-white">Unleash Your Business.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gold/80 mt-3 tracking-wider uppercase font-medium">Built for the Trades</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════ SUCCESS STORY ═══════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="results" class="section-padding bg-[#FAFAF8] dark:bg-surface-dark">
    <div class="container-default">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <p class="text-xs text-gold tracking-widest mb-4 uppercase font-semibold">Real Results</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-heading mb-6">How We Grew an HVAC Business</h2>
        <p class="text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Here's what it looks like when everything works together.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="rounded-sm overflow-hidden border border-[#E8E4DC] dark:border-border-dark">
          <a href="https://completehomecomfortpgh.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <Image
              src={chcImage1}
              alt="Complete Home Comfort PGH website built by TechHound"
              width={800}
              class="w-full hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </a>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold mb-2 text-heading">Complete Home Comfort PGH</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gold mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium">HVAC &middot; Pittsburgh, PA</p>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-8">
            <p>
              Complete Home Comfort came to us with no website and no online presence. We built them the full package, and now they're one of the fastest-growing HVAC companies in the Pittsburgh area.
            </p>
            <p>
              Here's what we set up for them:
            </p>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-gold font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
              <span class="text-secondary text-sm"><strong class="text-heading">Custom website</strong> with service pages, a free estimate flow, and a project gallery</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-gold font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
              <span class="text-secondary text-sm"><strong class="text-heading">Photo sync</strong> from Instagram to his website, Yelp, and Google automatically</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-gold font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
              <span class="text-secondary text-sm"><strong class="text-heading">Google review replies</strong> automated with local SEO keywords to boost his rankings</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-gold font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
              <span class="text-secondary text-sm"><strong class="text-heading">Automated blog posts</strong> building topical authority for HVAC services in his area</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-gold font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
              <span class="text-secondary text-sm"><strong class="text-heading">Seasonal email campaigns</strong> that go out to his full customer list every spring and fall, automatically</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-gold font-bold text-sm mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
              <span class="text-secondary text-sm"><strong class="text-heading">Google Business Profile optimization</strong> with reviews, photos, and posts all syncing automatically</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://completehomecomfortpgh.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-outline !text-xs !px-5 !py-2.5">
            Visit Their Site &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════ PHOTO BREAK: FOUNDATION ═══════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative h-56 sm:h-64 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: url('/images/reno-foundation.webp');"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    <div class="relative text-center px-4 max-w-xl">
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-white font-heading font-semibold mb-2">From our home renovation in Pittsburgh.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#ccc]">We understand the trades because we do the work ourselves.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════ PRICING ═══════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="pricing" class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-default">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <p class="text-xs text-gold tracking-widest mb-4 uppercase font-semibold">Simple Pricing</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-heading mb-6">No Hidden Fees. No Contracts.</h2>
        <p class="text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Get everything your trade business needs online for one flat monthly price. Or pick just the tools you need.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Full Package -->
        <div class="card p-8 border-gold/30 relative">
          <div class="absolute -top-3 left-6">
            <span class="text-[10px] px-3 py-1 rounded-sm bg-gold text-void font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Most Popular</span>
