          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-heading mb-2">The Full Package</h3>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-4">
            <span class="text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-gold">$100</span>
            <span class="text-secondary text-sm">/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Everything we offer, bundled together. This is what most of our clients go with.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-secondary">
              <span class="text-gold mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
              <span>Custom contractor website</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-secondary">
              <span class="text-gold mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
              <span>Managed hosting and maintenance</span>
