            class="w-full"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold mb-2 text-heading">Klaus</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gold mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium">Co-Founder &middot; Engineering</p>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Klaus graduated from the University of Pittsburgh with a degree in computer engineering. He's built software for Fortune 500 companies like Lubrizol and for federal agencies including the FDIC, TVA, and DOT. Today he works as a software engineer at <strong class="text-heading">DraftKings</strong>.
            </p>
            <p>
              Outside of work, he's currently renovating his house, doing everything from demo to framing to finish work. When we say we understand the trades, we mean it. We know what it's like to be covered in drywall dust at 10pm and still need to answer customer calls in the morning. That's exactly why we built these tools, so you can focus on the work and let the tech run itself.
            </p>
            <p>
              When you work with TechHound, you talk directly to the people building your project. No sales team, no account managers. The person on the call is the person writing the code.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="rounded-sm overflow-hidden border border-[#E8E4DC] dark:border-border-dark lg:order-2">
          <Image
            src={samImage}
